\newlabel{fig:cv}{{1.3}{10}{The clause--variable game of a $3$-CNF. An edge is a pair (clause, variable occurring in it). The highlighted edge $(C_2,x_3)$ is accepted iff Alice's assignment to $C_2$ and Bob's bit agree on~$x_3$, \ie iff the projection $\pi _{(C_2,x_3)}$ of Alice's label to the coordinate $x_3$ equals Bob's label}{figure.1.3}{}}
